{"id":"infa_ncia","lemma":"infância","pos":"noun","rank":1835,"glosses":["infancy","childhood"],"ipa":"/ĩˈfɐ̃.sjɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"infâncias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-inf%C3%A2ncia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ela teve uma infância feliz.","en":"She had a happy childhood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/49971","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"happy"}]},{"text":"Eu lembro bem a minha infância.","en":"I remember my childhood well.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to remember","l":"lembrar"},{"g":"well"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"the missus"]]},{"text":"Ele era bem fraco na infância.","en":"He was quite weak in his childhood.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"weak"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Aprendi isso no jardim de infância.","en":"I learned that when I was in kindergarten.","words":[{"g":"to learn","l":"aprender"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"garden"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ele se conhecem desde a infância.","en":"They have known each other since their childhood.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"if / oneself"},{"g":"to know","l":"conhecer"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the / to"},null]}]}